{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"baa97c483cbcb547c8f9913813b99fe9de6ce46d3dfb66644828b7e05736caae","ja":"ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、ワン、ツー……。\nで、フィニッーシュ！　……ね、どうだった！　今の？","zh":"一、二、三、四，一、二……。\n然后，结束——！……怎么样！刚才那段？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"59f65ac4b67608aaa0145213e04b87849fc15c45f088b19294b788235a3eb1b8","ja":"うん、バッチリできてたよ！","zh":"嗯，做得非常棒！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ff028586d0d345aea1aaf777066b6495838d2a22f341d0944f8aef0ad67f05e1","ja":"やったーっ！\n翼、静香ちゃん、ありがとーっ！","zh":"太好了——！\n翼、静香，谢谢你们——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"24faa083833c0721241f16ac0953c23b11e62c17800fb7bf53011242f4694acd","ja":"ふう……。なんとか、\nリハーサルに間に合ったわね。","zh":"呼……总算赶上彩排了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5f7893f0949fd684cdc0bee6db95ef6b3a24b06166ce475b70bf5dd2c37d3b72","ja":"でも、屋上でダンスするのって、気持ちいいね。\nたまにはこんなレッスンも良いかも♪","zh":"不过，在屋顶跳舞，感觉真不错呢。\n偶尔来做这样的训练也不错♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5bb6d61db142085f9e55b08a42d47827083b912474b2e6f0ba0ec6de7db5afbf","ja":"でしょ？　それに、なんだか空で\n世界とつながってるような気持ちになれるんだよ。","zh":"对吧？而且，总觉得能通过天空与世界相连呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"bb45b4db305313e29ffc85d7f7358232b97dfa316912bf8a472868441521e8de","ja":"前に静香ちゃん、言ってたでしょ？　大きな舞台に\n立ちたいって。そんな気分が味わえるみたいで……。","zh":"静香以前不是说过吗？说想站上大舞台。好像能体验到那种感觉……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"1d1ba5fae6669791012e1e86c834dc1a76a3039ab63c47eefc43e4de1ba5a992","ja":"……あっ！！","zh":"……啊！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"20920e3565d177cd0060bb9e70e66dcf840c5bccfcd9e5d513d01f35e4d03fe6","ja":"わっ、びっくりした！\n……どうしたの、静香ちゃん？","zh":"哇，吓我一跳！\n……怎么了，静香？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"62a6686106f31000b2d4ccaa20dccbce587ef84efdfe874aa6b1d0c5974329d2","ja":"今日、世界的な音楽の賞の中継があったの。\nリハの前に、一緒に観ようと思ってたんだけど……。","zh":"今天有全球音乐大奖的转播。本来想着在彩排前和你一起看的，可是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"06f8a40d635d2dec6d799e834bd09f12b425413a3737630b81bbc614f00c1f44","ja":"……そっか！\nだからリハの前に、わたしと未来を探してたんだね。","zh":"……这样啊！\n所以你是在彩排前找我和未来，对吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"505aa75ebd327de1e4295e5c2874e467f561468015f01efb4e8a682419d4a128","ja":"わわっ、そうだったんだ！　ごめんね、静香ちゃん。\nそっちを観た方が、大きな舞台を感じられたのに……。","zh":"哇，原来是这样！对不起，静香。要是看那边的话，就能更感受到大舞台了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b5facf94cedb812a39e260ccc9cb17c140a4b0b57a5acf1e7a7fdfaa94f1390a","ja":"……いいわ。●●●●プロデューサーが\n録画してくれてるかもしれないし……。","zh":"……好吧。●●●●制作人说不定正在帮我录下来……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_878.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"a790bbf126ac70737693b3a218f984afff1fc9b77b846fb2d004b3240f507ffc","ja":"それに私も、ここで3人でレッスンできて\n楽しかったから。……さ、リハーサルに行きましょ♪","zh":"而且，我也很开心能在这里和3个人一起练习。……那么，我们去彩排吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
